  "title": "Cyclone 'Arnab' and Cyclone 'Murasu' in India: Preparation and Impact",
  "summary": "Cyclone 'Arnab' is expected to intensify into a severe cyclonic storm, impacting Andhra Pradesh and Odisha with heavy rainfall and potential infrastructure damage. Cyclone 'Murasu', a second cyclone, is anticipated to strike the coast of Andhra Pradesh on November 3, affecting the area with strong winds and gusts.",
